      "body": "The consensus outlook for revenues in fiscal year 2026 has deteriorated. 2026 revenue forecast decreased from ₹21.1b to ₹18.8b. Forecast loss of -₹0.40, down from profit of ₹23.30 per share profit previously. Real Estate industry in India expected to see average net income growth of 49% next year. Consensus price target down from ₹494 to ₹479. Share price was steady at ₹362 over the past week.",
