      "date": "2026-02-06T11:42:20.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues miss analyst expectations",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.51 (down from ₹3.33 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹2.82b (down 19% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹45.0m (down 82% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.6% (down from 7.2% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Revenue missed analyst estimates by 61%. Earnings per share (EPS) also missed analyst estimates by 93%. Revenue is forecast to grow 19% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 24% growth forecast for the Real Estate industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 11% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 11% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
